[2026-07-19T12:38:19.386Z] [INFO]         "type": "tool_result",
[2026-07-19T12:38:19.386Z] [INFO]         "content": "# Helm OCI Registry Support\n\n**OCI Registry Recommendation:**\n\"It is recommended to use container registries with OCI support to store and share chart packages.\"\n\n**Stability Status:**\nThe documentation includes a warning: \"This page has not yet been updated for Helm 4. Some of the content might be inaccurate or not applicable to Helm 4.\" This suggests OCI support was introduced in earlier versions (v3), but the exact GA version is not explicitly stated in this excerpt.\n\n**Helm Push Usage:**\nThe `push` command uploads packaged charts to OCI registries. Key requirements include:\n- Charts must be packaged as `.tgz` files beforehand using `helm package`\n- Registry references require the `oci://` prefix without the basename or tag\n- The chart name becomes the repository basename and semantic version becomes the tag automatically\n- Example: `helm push mychart-0.1.0.tgz oci://localhost:5000/helm-charts`"
[2026-07-19T12:38:19.386Z] [INFO]       }
