[2026-07-19T12:45:12.560Z] [INFO]           "command": "git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(ci): make Helm release fail loudly instead of silently publishing nothing\n\nThe Helm Release job has been green on every run since 2025-12-23 while\npublishing nothing. The public chart repository is still at 0.38.8\n(2025-12-11) though package.json is at 2.8.3 — ~7 months of no-op releases\nreported as success.\n\nRoot cause: commit 5b7e60d7 converted helm-release.sh (which opened with\n`set -euo pipefail`) to .mjs using command-stream's `$`, which resolves with\n`.code` instead of throwing on a non-zero exit. The wrapping try/catch could\ntherefore never fire. In production `git checkout gh-pages` aborted because\ngh-pages also carries the repo tree and the script had just rewritten\nChart.yaml; the failure was swallowed, the index was committed onto main,\n`git push origin gh-pages` reported \"Everything up-to-date\", and the script\nprinted \"released successfully!\" and exited 0.\n\nVerified experimentally (experiments/issue-2082-command-stream-throw.mjs):\ncommand-stream's `$` returns code 1 without throwing.\n\n- add scripts/run-command.lib.mjs with runStrict(), restoring `set -e`\n  semantics on top of node:child_process (built-ins only, matching the\n  hardening already applied in publish-to-npm.mjs for #2028)\n- extract scripts/helm-release.lib.mjs so the flow is unit-testable\n- publish from an isolated `git worktree` instead of switching branches in\n  the dirty release checkout, removing the failure at its source\n- copy the archive next to index.yaml so its download URL resolves\n  (production emitted a .helm-packages/ URL that 404s)\n- verify the pushed index really contains the released version, so a future\n  regression is a red build rather than a silent no-op\n- add HIVE_MIND_CI_VERBOSE=1 command tracing, off by default\n\ntests/helm-release-2082.test.mjs pins all three properties. Confirmed by\nmutation: restoring fail-soft semantics fails the test with\n\"a failing git command must abort the release\".\n\nAlso compiles the full evidence pack and analysis into\ndev/log/issues/2082/pulls/2083/.\n\nRefs #2082\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1",
[2026-07-19T12:45:12.560Z] [INFO]           "description": "Commit the F1 fix"
