[2026-07-19T13:12:04.986Z] [INFO]           "+#   version bump back to main. Cancelling it in between leaves the registry ahead",
[2026-07-19T13:12:04.986Z] [INFO]           "+#   of the repository — the same split-brain state as issues #2082/F4 and #2082/F5,",
